{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-13_end",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-13",
  "title": "Battered and Bruised",
  "storyCode": "12-15",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-13_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c626df629735124e693325c65f30fae9e3d74f002aa8c933eb314f7e993c2f71",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "We're only a few hours away from the sunrise Miss Ines stipulated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "We need to hurry up the pace of our evacuation op."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "Say, haven't you forgotten something even more important, Doctor of Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "There's the airship too.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Yes, we and Dublinn are starting from the same line again."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Which means, time is of the essence."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "To forever abide by commitments is not solely what we ask of ourselves... but of those we make deals with, too."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "You've finally made it. I almost got offed by that Redsteel Guard boy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Her Grace is very dissatisfied with your indolence. Your methods are too tepid."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Or is it that you're coaxing Alexandrina? Playing on her sympathies?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "That's a very grave accusation. I'm unconditionally loyal to Her Grace, that much is obvious, I'm just..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "We'll review your excuses in hindsight. For now, though, there's no time."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Stay put, Rhodes Islanders."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "What are you doing?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Arts in black... Just as the fresh intel described."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "You've kept it very well hidden, Rhodes Island. To think this Cautus is the Sarkaz's very Lord of Fiends."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Very interesting... Perhaps this <i>is</i> an issue that can't be solved without you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Poet, to not have recognized this is a further failure of your duties."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "By what means does Her Grace hope for me to remedy this?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "While you were chatting with Dublinn, we've had the position of the airship's dock confirmed. It's... treacherous in there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "But our fresh intel tells us the 'Lord of Fiends' will have some way to handle it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "So, little Lord of Fiends, you'll cooperate with us, won't you."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "And what about that Windermere girl?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
          "text": "Forget trying to make up for things. The technology of the airship is our number one priority."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "Think we've notified about everyone we could find."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "And that... caps off all we can do."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "Amiya isn't back yet, and neither the Doctor nor Ines have been in touch."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "Looks like somewhere's caught fire outside again."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "That's—where the hotel is."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "We'd better go take a look."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "*pant*... *pant*..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "Delphine? What are you sprinting like that for?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "—Where's that Rhodes Island lot?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "I'll lay this out straight. Listen up, Alexandrina Vina Victoria."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "Amiya and the Doctor got pushed by the 'Trilby Asher' into fulfilling that deal. They need to find the airship."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "Duke Wellington's army is on this plate already. Afraid Duke Caster's reinforcements are here too."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "They're all out to win the technology behind that Sarkaz airship. None of them will let their rivals have the advantage of getting it first."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "Norport's become the dukes' wrestling ring."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
          "text": "Hah. Surprising exactly no one."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
          "text": "What about that broadcast? You know, pushing the dukes into officially attacking this place—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "Miss Ines says she'll do all she can to make it happen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
          "text": "To what? What are you telling us?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "She says, she needs until sunrise."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "Got it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "Assuming the dukes go with direct confrontation after all, how much time do we still have?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "As long as Miss Ines succeeds... the Duke of Windermere's high-speed warship should be approaching not long after the sun comes up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "You've got a hell of a lot of people gathered here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
          "text": "The people who aren't here probably already got the news. Anyone who does want to come with us'll keep with the procession."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "So I suggest before the Duke's warship officially encroaches, we continue to wait here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "With the present circumstances... going out in the street's not a good idea."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
          "text": "Doesn't matter if it's Wellington or Caster, they won't hold back against anyone they think's in the way."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "No. We're best off leaving now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "The Sarkaz barracks around the barricade wall got ambushed. Odds are more than likely some duke's forces did it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "We should get as close as we can to the part of the wall that's thin on defenses, while it's still night."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "More importantly... we need to let them all know, everyone still peeping out from behind their windows, that what we said was true."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "This evacuation isn't some scheme to nab the last of their reserves. It's not some Sarkaz trap to wipe them out."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "Reestablishing trust is a challenge, and the one and only way to do it—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
          "text": "Is for them to see real action."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Here, the books you asked me for last time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "I had to spend an age searching in those Londinium libraries, not even knowing Victorian. Grabbed some poor Feline in the end to find your stuff."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "Thank you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Sometimes I see you writing and drawing in this blank book too."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "You don't just read, you write your own stuff too?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "I've never been to Kazdel, but I hear they've got a whole Sarkaz university underground there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Are you a teacher there?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "No, I'm just like you. Putting my life up for sale."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Are these books really that fun to read?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "They all end fine enough, but similar events keep happening over and over."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "All the authors can do is keep writing fine enough endings."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "And I've gotten sick of it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General Manfred made us lock you in here, but hasn't given any further orders since..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "How did you offend him?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "Maybe, he just thought jail would be more peaceful for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "It's easier in here... to do whatever I'd actually like to do."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "And that's reading?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "You really are a boring guy, then."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "I hear... us Sarkaz are going to get some real good news, real soon."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "So good it'll stun the entire land!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "It's just going to be another war."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Has anyone ever told you you're a drag to talk to?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hoederer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
          "text": "Honestly, yeah."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Seriously... what a drag."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Alright, I'm changing shifts. You behave in here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Don't forget, you promised to pay me for the books—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The Royal Court soldier's silhouette disappears with a wobble into the end of the prison corridor, and very soon, a different set of footsteps comes into earshot.\nHoederer waits.\nBut there is only quiet."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Royal Court Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "The crew are all aboard the airship now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Understood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Paprika."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
          "text": "Urk... Here!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Have you ever read a book called... <i>A History of Sarkaz War?</i>"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
          "text": "No."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "You should. I have a copy in my drawer. You can take it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
          "text": "Is it a very fancy story?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "It is a history annals."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
          "text": "You said that already..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Then you shouldn't be asking that sort of question."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I disapprove of near to every viewpoint expressed in it. The weakness, the grief, the crushing."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "But still, I recognize that it is a book whose pages are soaked in blood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
          "text": "How would the writer describe the war we're seeing right now?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I'm as curious as you."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
